===Verb===
{{tft-verb|j=أكو}}

# {{lb|tft|auxiliary}} to be [[allowed]], [[may]]
#: {{uxi|tft|'''aku''' ua sakali-sakali ana ihoru sosira|t=it is absolutely not '''allowed''' that they paddle earlier}}
